oc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"id\": \"bd4cf3022c233cd4\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4645983517076689, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.29356095958238415, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8636856, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 20034, \"chunk_count\": 14, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:06\", \"token_count\": 7244, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"@dmathieu if you have the chance to review, this is related to other optimization PRs.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**dashpole** — 2025-12-11T20:43:53Z\\n\\nI figured out why the benchmark results were so poor: The benchmark was recording all observations in a single bucket, and each bucket has its own lock, so there were effectively no parallelism gains.  I switched the benchmark to record observations in different buckets, and that shows that this is a ~70% performance improvement when exemplars are being recorded.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-05]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Optimize histogram reservoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_histogram_reservoir` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +173 / -61 across 8 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Reviews (19)\\n\\n**MrAlias** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T16:04:21Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T16:12:33Z\\n\\n**MrAlias** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T16:34:09Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T17:34:51Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T20:12:48Z\\n\\n**MrAlias** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T22:44:49Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-04T03:45:24Z\\n\\n**MrAlias** — APPROVED — 2025-10-07T15:50:33Z\\n\\n**bboreham** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-12T21:22:58Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-15T01:06:50Z\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"dmathieu if you have the chanc to review this is relat to other optim pr dashpol 2025 12 11t20 43 53z i figur out whi the benchmark result were so poor the benchmark wa record all observ in a singl bucket and each bucket ha it own lock so there were effect no parallel gain i switch the benchmark to record observ in differ bucket and that show that this is a 70 perform improv when exemplar are be record sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z branch optim _ histogram _ reservoir main chang 173 61 across 8 file label mileston v1 400 review 19 mralia comment 2025 10 03t16 04 21z dashpol comment 2025 10 03t16 12 33z mralia comment 2025 10 03t16 34 09z dashpol comment 2025 10 03t17 34 51z dashpol comment 2025 10 03t20 12 48z mralia comment 2025 10 03t22 44 49z dashpol comment 2025 10 04t03 45 24z mralia approv 2025 10 07t15 50 33z bboreham comment 2025 10 12t21 22 58z dashpol comment 2025 10 15t01 06 50z\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentel